WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Use your existing customer account. The summary belongs only to the signed-in owner.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Read order, payment and delivery separately. Amounts keep their original purchase currency.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The owning store handles details, returns and support. There is no shared store balance.
